{"version":1,"key":"article:69","content":{"id":69,"title":"深拷贝的实现","author":"","content":[{"collabId":"014081b4-1b14-4ffd-aa41-6f76cc0928b3","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么是拷贝？对一个变量进行拷贝是指将其表示的数据复制到另一个变量中，大部分情况下的目的是为了避免直接修改原始数据，以便后续进行多种不同的处理或对比。"}]},{"collabId":"0b64244e-0423-405f-81a0-7f150dda5e2a","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最简单的拷贝行为，直接将一个变量赋值给另一个变量"}]},{"collabId":"fce347ed-cead-4575-a865-dc3a9eee2f70","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"8f913376-0589-4d7d-a0d2-463dfa6ab843","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"let a = 1;\nlet b = a;\nb = 2;\nconsole.log(a, b); // 1, 2"},{"collabId":"f9d33729-8b11-46c6-92ad-fe4a671cc654","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"770f270e-2864-4cd6-a880-a1a8135d1280","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = originalObj;\ncopyObj.a = 2;\nconsole.log(originalObj.a, copyObj.a); // 2, 2"},{"collabId":"2f791200-0c10-4745-89c2-e634e7d92896","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到，这种直接赋值的方式对于基本数据类型和对象是不一样的，对于基本数据类型（"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"number"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"string"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"boolean"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"BigInt"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）直接赋值是完全隔离的，对拷贝的修改不会影响原数据，而对于对象（包括数组、日期、函数等特殊对象）直接进行赋值拷贝，"},{"bold":true,"color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","type":"formatted","text":"拷贝的仅仅是引用"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此对通过拷贝所持有的引用对数据进行的修改也会影响原来的对象。"}]},{"collabId":"bf181a74-6cea-414d-850b-9c43bce82f20","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此对于对象的拷贝不能通过直接赋值来达到目的，而是需要将引用的数据进行拷贝，根据拷贝方式的不同，分为浅拷贝和深拷贝。"}]},{"collabId":"3a8e28b7-3f18-4a14-834c-4994cebebd97","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浅拷贝即只复制对象的一层属性，常见的方式有"}]},{"collabId":"e27ba423-7c4f-4c48-bc64-99ca07ee7734","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"8f044d89-7bf5-470d-8ff0-88ca4fac1b25","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = {};\nfor (let key in obj1) {\n    obj2[key] = obj1[key];\n}"},{"collabId":"2b24cc6e-4fe7-4b3b-8893-997b930fd19c","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"00fdb771-defb-4694-afd9-c9f216703eb3","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = { \n    ...obj1\n}"},{"collabId":"40f812a8-5940-4626-9efc-1a62578a364e","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"f148df4b-57e1-48bd-a462-a525dd092a23","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1\n}\nconst copyObj = Object.assign({}, originalObj);"},{"collabId":"f100e690-34cd-47d6-bca5-058336ff1794","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果对象的属性的值也是一个对象，那么就会存在问题，复制的仍然是一个引用，对该引用的修改同样会影响原对象"}]},{"collabId":"05c88e44-5bad-4b2d-b1e7-d65c99bca144","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"f5033822-9a7d-461d-83a6-fa56705609db","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: {\n        b: 1\n    }\n}\nconst copyObj = Object.assign({}, originalObj);\ncopyObj.a.b = 2;\nconsole.log(originalObj.a.b, copyObj.a.b); // 2 2"},{"collabId":"64267b0f-bfd4-47e7-8763-2d6377a7b1a1","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望对拷贝的值的修改完全不影响原对象，这种情况下就需要进行深拷贝了。"}]},{"collabId":"2579adab-394d-42f5-8314-63b04bcd9789","color":"red","type":"highlight-block","children":[{"collabId":"a921e37d-c668-49b9-b69a-2e7753c123ca","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大部分情况下不需要使用深拷贝，原因："}]},{"collabId":"2a83dd3a-c536-450c-8387-b447ec2b6b13","type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"collabId":"998ec191-4b69-4f20-95f0-32e41dbdbe16","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"7e99fc27-6e6d-424f-8c5a-4faf5add3176","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浅拷贝够用了"}]}]},{"collabId":"c711c804-8c31-4147-83f9-f13a91aed001","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"c350f199-321f-4844-9b4a-b52d3d64a478","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"深拷贝性能较低"}]}]}]}]},{"collabId":"cc183ac9-b3b2-4ea3-bed9-7dca9fa55781","level":2,"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JSON.parse、JSON.stringify"}]},{"collabId":"7931eeab-e412-4c06-8b77-620e1cec0c25","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一种序列化的方式是将对象先序列为字符串，然后根据字符串重新反序列化为对象，该种方式创建的对象是完全开辟一块新的内存空间，和原来的对象没有任何关系："}]},{"collabId":"eebe139b-3945-41f4-aab5-8e6f42f3e85f","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"7f0facbc-cd32-4544-8e03-3de0924dba35","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: {\n        b: 1\n    }\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));\ncopyObj.a.b = 2;\n\nconsole.log(originalObj.a.b, copyObj.a.b); // 1 2"},{"collabId":"edc1e584-affb-4fa1-870f-cde3e1ac2857","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是该种方式有很多缺点："}]},{"collabId":"1c1b4b4c-fac1-4e16-a2ad-bc5c177c806b","type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"collabId":"cb0c7e7d-6013-46b8-a4da-6e91c2e3d4de","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"ee907232-218a-4fff-803b-b865df30d08c","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只能处理被序列化的对象，对于特殊类型的对象在反序列化时会丢失特定的类型信息"}]},{"collabId":"c417e30a-106c-46ac-b027-b468ea74ae1d","type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"collabId":"80f303d0-9f82-420f-83ed-12667bb76df6","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"832d67f5-3a73-4d51-9f1c-4b60f5060b53","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Date"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被序列化为字符串"}]}]},{"collabId":"e1ee9b1b-cfa8-453a-8fe5-a9815088d8db","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"0db44513-47ad-4911-9054-9ca672c75479","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"RegExp"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Promise、Map、Set、WeakMap、WeakSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被序列化为空对象"}]}]},{"collabId":"429062ac-62b4-41d4-b675-6c64b39e86e0","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"ba9b6968-2ede-4f91-bc56-bc59fc963a69","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Function"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，DOM 对象会被忽略"}]}]}]},{"collabId":"62c760d0-73c5-4a04-b91c-bd245c40f608","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"6e6e5e93-e61b-4728-85e5-6c2dc6592ebc","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: new Date(),\n    c: new RegExp('\\\\d{2}'),\n    d: function () {\n        return 'hello'\n    },\n    e: Promise.resolve('world'),\n    f: new Map([['a', 1], ['b', 2]]),\n    g: new Set([1, 2, 3]),\n    h: new WeakMap(),\n    i: new WeakSet()\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));"},{"collabId":"49418009-5a70-407b-8697-f768007dfb1d","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ce054a3-ba08-44ff-9851-3b8ebad6bfeb.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2ce054a3-ba08-44ff-9851-3b8ebad6bfeb.png","width":304,"naturalWidth":855,"naturalHeight":740,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"collabId":"c90a9f30-b1ee-4011-b12a-cec29133519b","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"8be27fa9-9a87-490b-8bb8-c39b9ff3c1e9","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法处理循环引用，如果对象中存在循环引用，则 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"JSON.stringify"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会发生错误"}]},{"collabId":"077d8f38-ae1e-4db5-a359-826fc8362476","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"4a60b019-2ac7-4ee7-abd7-2a706b7a4c5b","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {}\noriginalObj.self = originalObj;\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));"},{"collabId":"a918666b-18a5-4a74-a921-c30ff13f4974","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_11373c8e-c8e7-4727-9d14-d6b9884b65a1.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_11373c8e-c8e7-4727-9d14-d6b9884b65a1.png","width":323.2,"naturalWidth":909,"naturalHeight":127,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"collabId":"25969692-9a4b-407e-85f0-09550d56eeca","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"67f4d4aa-03e0-4c87-9d35-14dcc9c1f8c5","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"BigInt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这些值的无法处理，对于值为 "}]},{"collabId":"676c124e-65c6-45d0-a1b7-7c85c6ed5241","type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"collabId":"6fbfc23c-309a-4118-9604-548983ee924b","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"d5bc3602-0f9b-4c2d-a50f-7dd950ff848f","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的属性在序列化会被忽略"}]},{"collabId":"712d6901-44ae-4070-b779-655c936d189c","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"15fd833d-aac8-4a1e-b729-9f56eff3b6dc","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: \"Hello\",\n    c: true,\n    d: null,\n    e: undefined,\n    f: Symbol(\"symbol\"),\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));"},{"collabId":"757184c7-d71a-4021-8c39-e9940d495788","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b0d57a2c-8c40-4730-827c-275aab1c8d80.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b0d57a2c-8c40-4730-827c-275aab1c8d80.png","width":314.6666666666667,"naturalWidth":885,"naturalHeight":520,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"collabId":"6bd1f635-df61-4770-bff1-c6b735f9f76d","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"8e9695e1-111f-4589-9082-1e831e6bddbb","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"BigInt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 则会报错"}]},{"collabId":"c75b360b-93b6-43bb-a000-f0c7e2790bc3","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"657c5ca5-38f8-4ae5-b487-e54c4e0891cf","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: BigInt(123),\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));"},{"collabId":"5b19316a-26b0-4ba8-a8ef-3237505e2aff","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ad968b60-4caa-46fe-a627-5aa79194d68a.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ad968b60-4caa-46fe-a627-5aa79194d68a.png","width":310.0444444444444,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}]},{"collabId":"a106651c-4f27-45c7-ab24-0b8e335b62fd","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"773b067f-4920-454a-945e-5189f13df714","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"NaN"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Infinity"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被序列化为 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"null"}]},{"collabId":"6982b943-3a49-45d0-8559-f27d07ba3bae","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"56fd1b73-c4de-4cfc-9381-50d588f9227c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: NaN,\n    c: Infinity,\n}\nconst copyObj = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(originalObj));"},{"collabId":"fe0948f7-b827-45a4-8d58-4e3cd30e8377","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8861ec48-2dc1-408a-9a0e-6e2be3a617bb.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8861ec48-2dc1-408a-9a0e-6e2be3a617bb.png","width":247.11111111111111,"naturalWidth":695,"naturalHeight":404,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]},{"collabId":"1a6be745-e7e6-4849-8883-57c28afee35c","level":2,"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"structuredClone 和 postMessage"}]},{"collabId":"19c4e4a4-9f86-4d05-95c9-8d20f9b90dfd","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器提供了一个  "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"structuredClone"},{"type":"formatted","text":"  API，它可以对数据进行深拷贝，它会递归的对输入对象进行拷贝，并且在递归的过程中会维护一个存储访问过的对象的表，防止无限递归和解决循环引用的问题。"}]},{"collabId":"8ce04942-d195-4ba4-b9ac-6e2e59731ac6","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"该 API 较新，可能存在"},{"collabId":"e39d69a2-3654-404f-90c5-4ba840f7d816","openEdit":false,"type":"link","url":"https://caniuse.com/?search=structuredClone%20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"兼容性"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"问题"}]},{"collabId":"0bf6cdd4-4a08-42df-995a-e634f6fb927e","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_42c9963e-ec38-4ac5-bfd6-a82a7235b10d.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_42c9963e-ec38-4ac5-bfd6-a82a7235b10d.png","width":336,"naturalWidth":2740,"naturalHeight":669,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"collabId":"4891c585-c3ce-41cf-803f-5bb726af8518","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外它只能拷贝可序列化的数据，如果存在不可序列化的数据则会报错，下面这些数据是不可序列化的："}]},{"collabId":"0b9a3009-57d5-4484-a03a-8f9aee0a59e3","type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"collabId":"7ffa5461-8007-4bc3-91a1-a6cd1eafee34","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"aca19ca0-3f44-4e00-86a0-d1af05bc5d94","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol"}]}]},{"collabId":"15d06b3b-4f77-4ac8-9813-ca3df221b8b7","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"4be720c8-e1da-4c94-8d13-13e87df52799","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Function"}]}]},{"collabId":"2381d2df-7da3-4744-a6f4-1b98632733c2","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"916e3d07-21ef-4587-ab4f-9c5677ee8382","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Promise"}]}]},{"collabId":"ab9395e5-fc2a-4272-ae7d-035a3bad32e0","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"37ba4bac-bc0e-4667-85a2-0a68d2e57ab6","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"WeakMap"}]}]},{"collabId":"9eabf986-48c3-48de-8773-bd854113764f","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"a5101bb6-5e46-4485-bfe2-733d2d96d790","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"WeakSet"}]}]},{"collabId":"cbb842c9-9cbb-4f34-b1a5-982253ffbebc","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"a1001369-cb5d-4219-94a5-c87a1e95a275","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DOM 对象"}]}]}]},{"collabId":"3afe2e2a-3f95-4483-9baa-93607173d0a1","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"b7e211b8-8c19-4cb3-958d-507b62eabeed","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: \"Hello\",\n    c: true,\n    d: undefined,\n    e: null,\n    f: NaN,\n    g: Infinity,\n    h: new Date(),\n    i: /\\d{2}/,\n    j: new Map([['a', 1], ['b', 2]]),\n    k: new Set([1, 2, 3]),\n    l: {\n        a: 1,\n    }\n}\noriginalObj.self = originalObj;\n\nconst copyObj = structuredClone(originalObj);\ncopyObj.j.set('c', 3);\ncopyObj.k.add(4);\ncopyObj.l.a = 2;"},{"collabId":"6e8cdce9-99c1-4087-88f6-40e6a2caa7aa","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b86298bb-b4dc-4115-962e-f62c7d9a67d4.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b86298bb-b4dc-4115-962e-f62c7d9a67d4.png","width":336,"naturalWidth":1080,"naturalHeight":1026,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"collabId":"ef42e38b-9bf9-4fdb-9f3b-698159e8913f","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可以使用 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"MessageChannel"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对数据进行拷贝，使用 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"postMessage"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传递数据时，也是深拷贝，其使用的算法和 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"structuredClone"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 相同，不同之处在于 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"MessageChannel"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 拷贝数据是异步的"}]},{"collabId":"953a189b-2d85-4175-b9a2-1f106b04714d","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"e80787b3-7224-4ce8-a1b9-cedbcb5a6db5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const deepCopy = (obj) => {\n    const channel = new MessageChannel();\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n        channel.port2.onmessage = (e) => {\n            resolve(e.data);\n        }\n        channel.port1.postMessage(obj);\n    });\n}"},{"collabId":"25817526-1ea7-415c-8445-aa08b1d6854a","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8a39e453-6f72-474f-92d4-cf30b540a256.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8a39e453-6f72-474f-92d4-cf30b540a256.png","width":336,"naturalWidth":1039,"naturalHeight":1042,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"collabId":"122d3f1c-4562-4b87-b510-f5cd7115da47","level":2,"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"手动递归拷贝"}]},{"collabId":"c0a2535d-a8b4-4544-b3ed-f23e9a87ca67","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了使用已有的 API，还可以手动递归对象来进行深拷贝。首先实现基本的递归拷贝"}]},{"collabId":"140500ad-2276-42de-8e0e-9252081d4df7","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"9097949b-c01f-45e4-a084-a69f171f7bc6","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const deepCopy = (value) => {\n    if (typeof value !== 'object' || value === null) {\n        return value;\n    }\n    const newObj = Array.isArray(value) ? [] : {};\n    for (const key in value) {\n        if (value.hasOwnProperty(key)) {\n            newObj[key] = deepCopy(value[key]);\n        }\n    }\n    return newObj;\n}"},{"collabId":"bd702fc0-33c0-49bc-b2d1-b746d7abab3b","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"d6e96be5-4506-4065-8a02-b6bc2147c87e","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: 'hello',\n    c: true,\n    d: undefined,\n    e: null,\n    f: NaN,\n    g: Infinity,\n    h: {\n        a: 1,\n    },\n    i: [1, 2, 3]\n}\n\nconst copyObj = deepCopy(originalObj);\ncopyObj.h.a = 2;\ncopyObj.i.push(4);"},{"collabId":"279733d6-dd6d-475d-bf96-82cdbf924351","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_93c3e1b9-798b-426b-b999-374b1f0246c9.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_93c3e1b9-798b-426b-b999-374b1f0246c9.png","width":336,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"collabId":"5bf51b0c-fb58-4fdf-bed8-c59fc1aeae82","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于基本的对象和数组拷贝没有问题，但是如果存在循环引用，如果自己引用自己，两个对象之间互相引用等，那么就会陷入无限的递归，直至爆栈"}]},{"collabId":"bb0c1684-633e-4aa9-a9bc-e59d5555f04a","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"f972c182-924d-4923-9494-25884a57018c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: 'hello',\n    c: true,\n    d: undefined,\n    e: null,\n    f: NaN,\n    g: Infinity,\n    h: {\n        a: 1,\n    },\n    i: [1, 2, 3]\n}\noriginalObj.self = originalObj;\n\nconst copyObj = deepCopy(originalObj);"},{"collabId":"3674cdf9-353b-4e24-8c55-c46e4caf29a3","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8302f60d-2c2c-48fa-80ce-71842a755a12.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_8302f60d-2c2c-48fa-80ce-71842a755a12.png","width":316.8,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"collabId":"e81aed85-058e-4de0-b306-842bc216b228","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了解决这个问题，需要在递归的过程中维护已处理过的对象，当后续访问到相同对象时，直接返回该对象而不用递归处理"}]},{"collabId":"b69a7883-cbde-45ff-80ad-a5ccb620a4e4","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"13db24f2-5b7c-4aa6-9abf-c31eee4784e5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const deepCopy = (value, weakMap = new WeakMap()) => {\n    if (weakMap.has(value)) return weakMap.get(value);\n    if (typeof value !== 'object' || value === null) {\n        return value;\n    }\n    const newObj = Array.isArray(value) ? [] : {};\n    weakMap.set(value, newObj);\n    for (const key in value) {\n        if (value.hasOwnProperty(key)) {\n            newObj[key] = deepCopy(value[key], weakMap);\n        }\n    }\n    return newObj;\n}"},{"collabId":"ee44d310-02c7-4117-a6ac-f04f8d1f4142","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_28812919-419f-4fe9-8fef-2522308ad701.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_28812919-419f-4fe9-8fef-2522308ad701.png","width":464.09089903200976,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"collabId":"f3b84663-6311-41da-9e0e-b6338832e660","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来需要对一些特殊的对象进行处理，如 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Function"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Date"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Map"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Set"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等，对于不能进行深拷贝的对象当作普通对象处理，如 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"WeakMap"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"WeakSet"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等"}]},{"collabId":"1d07cef8-f323-43f0-b4be-d680c4eacc21","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"78fad060-439b-4b55-96cb-3512b1032e05","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const deepCopy = (value, weakMap = new WeakMap()) => {\n    if (weakMap.has(value)) return weakMap.get(value);\n    if (typeof value !== 'object' || value === null) {\n        return value;\n    }\n    let newObj;\n    if (typeof value === 'function') {\n        newObj = new Function('return ' + value.toString())();\n    } else if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n        newObj = [];\n    } else if (value instanceof Date) {\n        newObj = new Date(value);\n    } else if (value instanceof RegExp) {\n        const { source, flags } = value;\n        newObj = new RegExp(source, flags);\n        // lastIndex 不可遍历\n        newObj.lastIndex = value.lastIndex;\n    } else if (value instanceof Map) {\n        newObj = new Map();\n        for (const [key, val] of value) {\n            newObj.set(deepCopy(key, weakMap), deepCopy(val, weakMap));\n        }\n    } else if (value instanceof Set) {\n        newObj = new Set();\n        for (const val of value) {\n            newObj.add(deepCopy(val, weakMap));\n        }\n    } else {\n        newObj = {};\n    }\n    weakMap.set(value, newObj);\n    for (const key in value) {\n        if (value.hasOwnProperty(key)) {\n            newObj[key] = deepCopy(value[key], weakMap);\n        }\n    }\n    return newObj;\n}"},{"collabId":"e7d7225d-33ff-4aff-9c36-db9e298bc79a","language":"JavaScript","type":"code-block","uuid":"e1216959-bd22-4e12-adcc-eb02de7d8576","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"const originalObj = {\n    a: 1,\n    b: 'hello',\n    c: true,\n    d: undefined,\n    e: null,\n    f: NaN,\n    g: Infinity,\n    h: Symbol(\"symbol\"),\n    i: BigInt(123),\n    j: {\n        a: 1,\n    },\n    k: [1, 2, 3],\n    l: new Date(),\n    m: /\\d{2}/,\n    n: new Map([['a', 1], ['b', 2]]),\n    o: new Set([1, 2, 3]),\n    p: new WeakMap(),\n    q: new WeakSet(),\n    r: function () {\n        return 'Hello'\n    },\n    s: Promise.resolve(\"Hello\")\n}\noriginalObj.self = originalObj;\n\nconst copyObj = deepCopy(originalObj);\ncopyObj.j.a = 2;\ncopyObj.k.push(4);\ncopyObj.n.set('c', 3);\ncopyObj.o.add(4);\nconst value = copyObj.r();\nconsole.log(value); // Hello"},{"collabId":"1f3bed50-e08e-4be2-8be7-1a21669792f8","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9fd48582-11f2-4a10-b187-61a840be0445.png","type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9fd48582-11f2-4a10-b187-61a840be0445.png","width":336,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]},{"collabId":"d690c978-2bc0-4de5-ab2b-147bb37b9f3d","level":2,"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"collabId":"cfecb180-b4b8-499d-a0f0-96d1cba0a314","type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"collabId":"f2340d09-4e80-46d4-9ad5-f5a2039b24bc","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"12fbbac7-12d8-4143-a65c-64a134c37803","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"collabId":"2cb40623-0ade-4416-a19f-80927a8ae341","openEdit":false,"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/structuredClone","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Window: structuredClone() method"}]}]}]},{"collabId":"733bb3bb-9308-4177-b633-074c9912ee7b","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"4e98c9ee-9cea-4edb-b17b-39d5dffa7078","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"collabId":"716cbe72-e47a-4192-939d-efe12e84eea9","openEdit":false,"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API/Structured_clone_algorithm","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"The structured clone algorithm"}]}]}]},{"collabId":"02805ed4-16fa-4c21-8a30-767469c0b3fa","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"29f5bc6c-4982-4e39-b0e0-8fe7cb8e11a4","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"collabId":"284c88fc-7e4a-4c29-b3fd-80359faa1550","openEdit":false,"type":"link","url":"https://www.cnblogs.com/echolun/p/16157161.html","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JS 从零手写一个深拷贝（进阶篇）"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/evgeni-tcherkasski-m9FIXWpx6bI-unsplash_bbd66ad3-7e35-4edc-9f8c-f2ef3f26a895.jpg","createTime":1734053984486,"updateTime":1791084804433},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1791084804433}}